# Full-feature version of ../bigbank-context.trace: the same nodes, links and labels, written with Trace's layout features. Not part of the held-out measure.
direction down
title "System context: Internet Banking System"

pill customer [span user]: Personal Banking Customer | a customer of the bank
row {
  banking [landmark]: Internet Banking System | view accounts, make payments
  engine mail [mail]: E-mail system | Microsoft Exchange
}
engine mainframe [server]: Mainframe Banking System | core banking information

customer -> banking : uses
customer <- mail : sends e-mails to
banking -> mail : sends e-mails, SMTP
banking -> mainframe : uses
